.DS_Store

# SSD working directory — selective commit (ADR-0008, v1.18.0+).
# Block everything under .ssd/ by default, then allow the durable artifact tree.
#
# CANONICAL SINGLE SOURCE (ADR-0013 extraction, v1.23.0). This file is the one authoritative copy of
# the selective pattern. `methodology/migrate.sh` (apply_selective_gitignore) appends its contents
# verbatim; `ssd-init/SKILL.md` Step 5 points here instead of re-listing the block. Edit only here.
.ssd/*
# Committed gate inputs (ADR-0015): portable test_command / feature_flag_marker so the gate
# configuration travels to every clone and CI runner. Machine state stays in .ssd/project.yml.
!.ssd/gate.yml
!.ssd/features/
!.ssd/milestones/

# `.ssd/*` matches DEPTH-1 children only. Without the two deny lines below, re-including features/
# and milestones/ would make EVERYTHING beneath them committable and the allow-list would be
# decorative — a stray secrets.env under a feature dir would sail through. Deny at every depth
# first, then re-include the directories, then the specific artifact filenames.
.ssd/features/**
.ssd/milestones/**
!.ssd/features/**/
!.ssd/milestones/**/

!.ssd/features/**/00-brief.md
!.ssd/features/**/01-architect.md
!.ssd/features/**/02-systems-designer.md
!.ssd/features/**/03-coder-status.md
!.ssd/features/**/04-code-review*.md
!.ssd/features/**/05-deploy.md
!.ssd/features/**/iterations/**/brief.md
!.ssd/features/**/iterations/**/coder-status.md
!.ssd/features/**/iterations/**/code-review/round-*.md
!.ssd/features/**/iterations/**/deploy.md

# Milestones: durable records committed; snapshot machinery local.
!.ssd/milestones/**/skeptic-before.md
!.ssd/milestones/**/skeptic-after.md
!.ssd/milestones/**/refactor-plan.md
!.ssd/milestones/**/refactor-prs.md
!.ssd/milestones/**/verification.md
!.ssd/milestones/**/review-*.md
!.ssd/milestones/**/feynman.md

# Machine-managed state even when nested inside the allowed trees. These deny lines come AFTER the
# negations above so they win (last matching pattern wins).
.ssd/features/**/iterations/**/deferred.yml
.ssd/features/**/current.yml.bak
.ssd/milestones/**/sha-before
.ssd/milestones/**/metrics-before.yml

# Audits stay gitignored — often sensitive (vendor names, internal opinions).
.ssd/audits/

# Personal notes
real-world-artifacts/
